{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y的感受描写不如X细密，尤其缺少X那种随音乐具体变化而展开的声响、力度、空间和身体感受，部分情绪提示也显得比较概括。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合普通观众边听边扫：左侧完整叙述，右侧感受词辅助，不必在大量感受描述中反复寻找人物正在经历什么；而且人物为什么克制、为什么突然不安、为什么重新放松，以及每次心态变化的前因后果，Y交代得更完整，前后心理转折也更连贯。X的关键词加亮确实更容易瞬间抓住段落重点，且音乐对应的细节、动态和感官变化明显更丰富，但感受信息过密，部分描述还会抢过人物叙事本身的注意力，个别地方甚至压缩掉了重要的心理动机。综合普通观众的实际观看体验，我更选Y，尽管X在音乐感受的细腻度上有明确优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21a58e52-9bfc-4bf5-9565-a5d7693a5237", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T073103728484Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:32:22.442152+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a685931e572d9b8be38af92c70d301bd39cb8ba692a09d88ff8474ec425de814", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144c